Check this public claim against the web, in plain language for the Owner, who reads on his phone.

{{question}}

Prefer recent primary sources. Cite a URL for every point and mark anything unverified. Keep it under 40 lines. Then give exactly one line VERDICT: followed by one word: VERIFIED (it happened as claimed), REFUTED (it did not), GOALPOST_MOVED (the claim's own terms or date were changed after it was made) or UNKNOWN (the sources do not settle it). Finish with a section headed SOURCES listing the URLs, one per line.
